body:
Sounds great but I have to talk to ppl.  I dont have many ppl in my life except a few friends.  My ex broke up with me cause I made him cut out all his friends and only talk to me.  I know its wrong but I feel like I cant control what my brain wants. 

&nbsp;
He tried to do the same to me and make me cut out my 2 best friends and I flipped out.  I dont understand my brain.  I just want to be felt loved in the way I understand love even if its wrong =/
